# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository carries code and documentation. The data it produces is
# reproducible from the endpoints, and too large to version.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw archive — ~6.8 GB of verbatim sprite / play-by-play / shift JSON for three
# seasons. Immutable once written; rebuild with `python src/run_pipeline.py`.
raw/

# Processed tables — derived from raw/, ~74 MB per full archive.
processed/

# Per-request scrape logs (several MB of JSONL). The completeness parquets in
# audit/ are the durable summary and ARE committed.
audit/*.jsonl

# Zenodo upload staging — the three season zips (~0.65 GB), their manifests,
# and upload notes. Not repo content; published separately once uploaded (see
# docs/RAW_ARCHIVE.md). Kept locally alongside the repo only for convenience.
zenodo_archive/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Cloudflare / deployment secrets
.env
.env.*
rclone.conf
*.key
*.pem

# Rendered figures. The four PNGs are committed — they are what the README and
# the docs point at, and a reader should not have to build 14M rows to see the
# result. Everything else here is regenerable output: the SVG companions, and
# any figure rendered to a different --out directory.
figures/*
!figures/fig1_shot_validation.png
!figures/fig2_tracking_validation.png
!figures/fig3_goal_map.png
!figures/fig4_puck_motion.png

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local development / diagnostic files
Readme_CG.md
RunIT.py
RunIT2.py
clip_server.py
check_audit.py
check_game.py
check_goals.py
test_r2.py
rink.png
